{"schema_version":"1.0.0","id":"cik-0002042694","cik":"0002042694","slug":"primo-brands-042694","name":"Primo Brands Corp","ticker":"PRMB","exchanges":["NYSE"],"sector":"Beverages","sic":"2080","country":"FL","website":"","listed_years":1.4,"first_annual":"2025-02-27","last_filing":"2026-07-16","annual_only":false,"edgar_url":"https://www.sec.gov/cgi-bin/browse-edgar?action=getcompany&CIK=0002042694&type=10-K","summary":{"sentences":["Primo Brands Corp files with the SEC under \"Beverages\", based in FL, and has been publicly reporting for 1 year.","It reported $6.7bn of revenue over the trailing four quarters, up 0.8% against the same quarter a year earlier, at a gross margin of 28.6%.","Listed on NYSE, it funds itself from operations ($581.0m of operating cash flow over the year)."],"generated":true,"note":"Assembled from filing metadata and XBRL figures. Not editorial judgement - and rule 7 asks whether *you* can explain it, so rewrite this in your own words before you rely on it."},"bull":[{"text":"Growth has been positive in all 4 year-on-year comparisons, so this is a trend rather than one good quarter.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2042694/000162828026031859/0001628280-26-031859-index.htm","accession":"0001628280-26-031859"},{"text":"Operating cash flow is positive at $581.0m over the trailing year, so the business funds itself and is not dependent on raising money.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2042694/000162828026031859/0001628280-26-031859-index.htm","accession":"0001628280-26-031859"},{"text":"Share count is close to flat (-4.1% over the year), so growth in the business accrues to existing holders rather than being diluted away.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2042694/000162828026031859/0001628280-26-031859-index.htm","accession":"0001628280-26-031859"}],"bear":[{"text":"Revenue grew only 0.8% year on year (Q1 2026 vs Q1 2025). Whatever the story is, it is not currently showing up in